      "heading": "REPEAT / GROWTH\n",
      "_template": "header"
    },
    {
      "level": "h3",
      "font": "sedan",
      "heading": "Every living being has a beginning and an end.\n\nOr perhaps not.\n\nMaybe nothing ever truly disappears.\n\n*What we call death is often just a transition. *A trace left behind. And that trace becomes the beginning of another life.\n",
      "_template": "header"
    },
    {
