      "font": "space-grotesk",
      "heading": "LOOK CLOSER\n",
      "_template": "header"
    },
    {
      "level": "h3",
      "heading": "Look closely, and you will discover fragments of many life forms—their bodies, textures, and characteristics woven into one another. Together, they represent the endless cycle of evolution, extinction, and regeneration.\n",
      "_template": "header"
    },
