    {
      "level": "h6",
      "font": "space-grotesk",
      "heading": "THE INVISIBLE NETWORK\n",
      "_template": "header"
    },
    {
      "level": "h3",
      "font": "sedan",
      "heading": "Biodiversity is not simply the coexistence of different species. It is the invisible network that connects them all. The richer and more complex this network becomes, the stronger and more resilient the ecosystem grows.\n",
      "_template": "header"
    },
    {
