      "heading": "LAYERS OF TIME\n",
      "_template": "header"
    },
    {
      "level": "h3",
      "heading": "Perhaps this is how life has always moved.\n\nNot in straight lines.\n\nBut in layers.\n\nEach generation leaving behind something for the next. Each ending quietly becoming another beginning.\n",
